{"updated":"2026-11-22T16:58+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Yellow rain warning","level":"yellow","headline":"A slow-moving band of heavy rain may cause some flooding and transport disruption, particularly across south Devon and south Cornwall.","description":"A band of rain will become slow-moving across southwest England during Sunday, before clearing on Sunday night. Rainfall totals of 20-40 mm are likely quite widely, with 50-70 mm over higher ground. There remains a chance of heavier and more persistent rain developing, which could bring 60-80 mm to some lower-lying areas too, particularly Torbay, South Hams and south Cornwall, and around 100 mm over Dartmoor.","impacts":["There is a chance that homes and businesses could be flooded, causing damage to some buildings","Spray and flooding could lead to difficult driving conditions and some road closures","Bus and train services affected with journey times taking longer and a chance of cancellations","There is a small chance that some communities will become cut off by flooded roads","There is a slight chance of power cuts and loss of other services to some homes and businesses"],"onset":"2026-11-22T06:00:00+00:00","expires":"2026-11-22T23:59:59+00:00","areas":[{"name":"South West England","polygons":[[[51.025,-4.355],[51.025,-4.341],[51.025,-4.327],[51.025,-4.313],[51.026,-4.298],[51.028,-4.284],[51.029,-4.269],[51.031,-4.255],[51.032,-4.24],[51.034,-4.225],[51.036,-4.21],[51.038,-4.196],[51.039,-4.18],[51.04,-4.165],[51.041,-4.15],[51.042,-4.132],[51.043,-4.114],[51.044,-4.096],[51.044,-4.078],[51.045,-4.059],[51.046,-4.041],[51.047,-4.022],[51.047,-4.003],[51.047,-3.984],[51.047,-3.966],[51.047,-3.948],[51.046,-3.93],[51.045,-3.912],[51.043,-3.895],[51.041,-3.879],[51.039,-3.863],[51.037,-3.848],[51.034,-3.833],[51.031,-3.818],[51.027,-3.804],[51.024,-3.789],[51.02,-3.775],[51.016,-3.76],[51.012,-3.746],[51.008,-3.731],[51.004,-3.716],[50.999,-3.701],[50.995,-3.685],[50.99,-3.667],[50.985,-3.648],[50.98,-3.63],[5